invariant: INV-14
file: webpki_ticket.c
catches: webpki_resume_test
reason: the ticket shape accepts a PSK of any non-zero length, though the
  binding reads SHA256_LEN bytes of it and ks_res_psk writes exactly
  that many. The one-short and one-over rows object.

--- old
    return cfg->resumption != 0 && cfg->psk != NULL && cfg->psk_len == SHA256_LEN &&
--- new
    return cfg->resumption != 0 && cfg->psk != NULL && cfg->psk_len > 0 &&
